        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Live Waveform Preview",
        "text": "<p>Quickly preview your sounds with live waveforms for fast, precise editing.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Visualize<\/strong> audio files instantly with waveform previews.<\/li><li><strong>Identify<\/strong> the right sound without trial and error.<\/li><li><strong>Works<\/strong> seamlessly across all 19 categories and custom uploads for efficiency.<\/li><\/ul>",
