        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Theme Editor",
        "text": "<p>Customize your workspace with flexible color themes.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Choose<\/strong> from 3 default themes: Blue, Red, and Rainbow.<\/li><li><strong>Create<\/strong> your own custom theme with adjustable primary and secondary colors.<\/li><li><strong>Personalize<\/strong> your workspace to match your creative flow.<\/li><li><strong>Enhanced Workflow<\/strong>: Favorites, advanced search, and intuitive customization options for all supported platforms.<\/li><\/ul>",
