        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Upload Assets",
        "text": "<p>Seamlessly upload and organize your custom sound effects.<\/p><ul><li><strong>1000+ SFX<\/strong>: Access over 1,000 sound effects across 19 categories with live waveform previews.<\/li><li><strong>Upload<\/strong> custom sounds or songs directly into the extension.<\/li><li><strong>Organize<\/strong> custom uploads in dedicated folders.<\/li><li><strong>Preview<\/strong> uploads instantly with live waveform visualization.<\/li><li><strong>Included Categories: <\/strong>Action, Alerts, Ambience, Camera, Cinematic Synth, Dramatic Drone, Drones, Effects, Electric, Explosion, Foleys, Glitch, Hits, Impacts, Rain, Reverse FX, Risers, Swooshes, Transitions<\/li><\/ul>",
