    "rich_text_aVqffV": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_7qQ3bA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sound Effect Categories:"
          }
        },
        "text_feEry4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h4><\/h4><ul><li><strong>Action (99)<\/strong> – High-energy sounds for action-packed sequences.<\/li><li><strong>Alerts (99)<\/strong> – Notification-style sounds for motion graphics and pop-ups.<\/li><li><strong>Ambience (116)<\/strong> – Background audio to create immersive environments.<\/li><li><strong>Camera (5)<\/strong> – Camera clicks, shutters, and adjustments.<\/li><li><strong>Cinematic Synth (41)<\/strong> – Atmospheric synth sounds for futuristic and cinematic projects.<\/li><li><strong>Dramatic Drone (24)<\/strong> – Suspenseful drones to build tension.<\/li><li><strong>Drones (75)<\/strong> – Deep, evolving soundscapes for setting the mood.<\/li><li><strong>Effects (142)<\/strong> – Versatile sound effects for various editing needs.<\/li><li><strong>Electric (46)<\/strong> – Static charges, zaps, and electronic sounds.<\/li><li><strong>Explosions (44)<\/strong> – Powerful explosion effects to add impact.<\/li><li><strong>Foleys (157)<\/strong> – Organic everyday sounds to enhance realism.<\/li><li><strong>Glitch (53)<\/strong> – Digital distortion, malfunctions, and error effects.<\/li><li><strong>Hits (232)<\/strong> – Hard-hitting sounds for trailers, stingers, and transitions.<\/li><li><strong>Impacts (136)<\/strong> – Strong, resonant effects for action sequences.<\/li><li><strong>Rain (13)<\/strong> – Atmospheric rain and storm effects.<\/li><li><strong>Reverse FX (53)<\/strong> – Swelling effects for seamless build-ups and transitions.<\/li><li><strong>Risers (101)<\/strong> – Tension-building sounds for dramatic moments.<\/li><li><strong>Swooshes (191)<\/strong> – Dynamic whooshes for movement and transitions.<\/li><li><strong>Transitions (72)<\/strong> – Seamless audio transitions for smooth scene changes.<\/li><li><strong>Custom Uploads: Unlimited<\/strong> – Import and organize personal sound libraries directly within Essential SFX.<\/li><\/ul>"
          }
        }
      },
